// Testable core of the Resend webhook handler.
//
// This module holds the handler's ENTIRE request→response orchestration as an
// exported async function with all collaborators injected via `deps`. It is the
// "functional core, imperative shell" split from the PRD: `index.ts` keeps the
// one-line `Deno.serve` binding (the untested shell that wires real deps), while
// everything branchy lives here so it can be exercised under vitest with no
// network, no live Supabase, and no Deno runtime.
//
